{"slug":"blast-protection-indicator","name":"Blast protection indicator","description":"A mod for displaying dressed leggings for explosion resistance. It helps to understand when greaves are worn for blast protection . There is a setting: transparency, position, on and off. I recommend using it with Centered Crosshair, ModMenu","author":"Kowalskiy","icon_url":"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/UtgXvKqi/5d26380696bf5576c39a7de79b1f24690a576b19_96.webp","download_count":400,"supported_versions":[{"name":"1.21.4","channel":"release"},{"name":"1.21.8","channel":"release"},{"name":"1.21.11","channel":"release"}],"supported_loaders":[{"id":"fabric","name":"Fabric"}]}